    ["Split", "The evidence budget goes to whichever scope the question is actually about, judged by dense similarity. There is no reranker. I measured one and deleted it."],
    ["Cite", "Passages keep document names and page numbers, are labelled as organisation or reference material, and citation numbers that point at nothing are dropped."],
